error[NK1131]: You can't give away `v[…]` here: `v` is only borrowed.
  --> tests/an_element_of_a_lent_list_passed_to_an_owning_parameter_is_refused.nika:8:5
   |
 8 |     lent_keep(o, v[0])
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `v` belongs to whoever lent it (a `ref` parameter, a `for` over a list, a `let` over a place), and `v[…]` is a `LentU`. Giving it away would take a piece out of something this function doesn't own.
   = help: Write `v[…].clone()` to pass a copy, or declare the parameter `ref LentU` if it only reads it.
